	(text "Mis-plug chain topology copied VERBATIM from hub-enterprise's per-port pattern (SMAJ58A shunt + SS110 100V series block, K toward the jack) + TPS26621 60V auto-retry eFuse (REQ-MOD-COMMON-053). D3 (SS34) ORs the tester's own USB-C-PD-derived +5V_LOGIC into the post-eFuse node so the RJ-45/mezzanine VCC pin never back-feeds. DETECT R7=1k [wb] series (bracket narrower than ENT's 10k since ST codes are lower, 2.2k/4.7k/10k -- firmware-recalibration item like the ENT precedent). Pin 7 stays a protected RESERVED SPARE (spec sec2.3 LOCKED, consumer/Standard tier) -- no MCU GPIO tap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 46.99 209.55 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 21 96 61 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "24949a5e-f7c9-4952-b428-05a3041a05cf")
	)
